# Deferred: tab bar re-tap pops to tab home

**Status:** Deferred. Deep navigation within a tab does not reset when the user taps that tab’s tab-bar icon again.

## Goal when revisiting

1. When the user has pushed into **subviews of a tab**, tapping that tab’s **tab-bar icon** should **pop back to that tab’s root / home** (standard iOS tab reselect behavior).
2. Apply across main tabs (closet/items, outfits/fitting, profile, etc. as applicable).
3. Prefer the platform pattern: only pop when re-selecting the **already selected** tab; selecting a different tab should switch normally.
4. Preserve nested NavigationStacks / path bindings used for profile and grid detail (see profile-nested-navigation rules) so pops don’t orphan destinations.

## When done

Remove this rule.
